{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50239","headline":"登灵岩寺（伯三六一九） · 沙门日进","name":"登灵岩寺（伯三六一九）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵岳多奇势，兹山负圣图。\n谷中清溜响，峯际白云孤。\n石壁连霄汉，长松落涧枯。\n澄心香阁下，烦虑寂然无。\n（斯三八一卷《龙兴寺毗沙门天王灵验记》，录「大蕃岁次辛巳润二月十五日」事，署「本寺大德僧日进附口抄」。\n疑即本诗作者。\n「大蕃岁次辛巳」即唐贞元十七年〖八○一〗。\n龙兴寺爲敦煌名刹，遗书中记载较多。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沙门日进","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}